{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_pinecn_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_pinecn_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"從頭來過","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_pinecn_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"fd47a07c2b757ffe7357b0d5e442fcd3e046ba0decdf65da9495b671363c0ca5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"松果誤會自己被羅德島開除後決定組建自己的工程隊。誤會解除後，她依然決定如此去做，她已經成長為成熟的工人，她有新的路要走。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛德森，抱、抱歉，我去晚了，餐廳的早餐已經沒剩什麼了，你將就吃一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，米娜姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了對了，我的履歷你有幫我交嗎？羅德島工程部同意我入職嗎？我是不是很快就能和你做同事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼了，你的表情看起來很奇怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒成功？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米娜姐姐，你是不是沒跟工程部的人說我和你是同鄉啊？我是特地來投奔你的，我的履歷很清白，不是什麼來歷不明的傢伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從小跟著父輩在工地上進進出出，砌磚、綁鋼筋、測量、搭鷹架……什麼類型的工作我都能做，羅德島可以先免費試用我一段時間的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛德森，過兩天，我們一起回哥倫比亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……我也被開除了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……松果需要離開羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越快越好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒得商量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒得商量。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是，他們為什麼這麼對你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你經常寄信回家，你的爸爸會把信拿給我們看，你每次不都說從來沒想過會遇見羅德島這樣的公司嗎？福利待遇好，也很有人情味……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是羅德島畢竟只是一家公司啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公司有需要員工的時候，就總會有不需要員工的時候……在哥倫比亞，我們見過很多這樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（擦眼淚）好了，愛德森，你記得吃早餐，我要先去工作了。艦橋檢修的工期很緊迫，工程部今天有得忙呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米娜姐姐，他們都這樣對你了，你還要跟沒事一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島之前並沒有虧待我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，屬於我的工作，必須要做完的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說我也想找卡夫卡問問清楚……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡夫卡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，米娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼眼睛紅紅的，沒睡好？打起精神來……啊，我有點事要去找酸糖，先走了先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有什麼話想跟我說嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，米娜，晚一點好嗎？再給我一點時間……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實你不用擔心我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，松果，別愣在那裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你光拎著一把釘槍就過來了啊，又把工具包忘在宿舍了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對不起，我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出門的時候走神了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是第一次了喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上週你把備用電池忘在了訓練場的施工區，等到訓練場快要關閉的時候才發現，整艘船的人都看著你氣喘吁吁地折返跑……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一樁樁一件件，我們可是都記得喔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是因為這個……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（米娜，誰會喜歡總丟三落四的人呢……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，先用我的工具包吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確認一下任務日誌，你負責左邊的區域，我負責右邊，今天之內得完成對艦橋的整體檢修。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前輩，為什麼這麼急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後，我們還需要對中層甲板、下層甲板，以及艦載天災預警系統和開採模組等重要區域進行檢修，為全艦拆分做最充分的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全、全艦拆分？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是說整艘陸行艦都要……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪大家最近看起來那麼忙碌……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前輩，我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小時候爸爸跟我說，哥倫比亞每天都有無數家新公司、無數支新工程隊誕生，但它們的總數其實一直都沒怎麼變過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我不懂那些話是什麼意思，後來我長大了，自己開始在一個又一個工程隊之間輾轉，看得多了，也就明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大地是無情的，公司和人一樣脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這句話怎麼聽起來那麼奇怪……算了我也解釋不清楚。工程部接到指令也沒多久，好好做完這最後的工作吧，松果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，今天下班後記得去工程部核對任務日誌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪要遣散員工……羅德島，這麼好的公司……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，米娜，你又能做什麼呢……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，艦橋檢修完畢，我來匯總並核對這段時間的任務日誌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，松果幹員，稍等片刻可以嗎，容我們處理完手頭的工作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些是全部了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥倫比亞煙酒施術單元以及源石製品管理局的核准公函，羅德島與萊茵生命等企業在醫藥、能源等領域的業務合作都逐一登記在案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最厚的這疊文件，是和雷姆必拓相關的……羅德島以工程部和幹員個人名義在雷姆必拓參與過數十次高難度開採作業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞的在這邊……萊塔尼亞……卡西米爾……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，全艦從檢修到拆分，這可能是工程部有史以來最忙的時候，我們真的不去幫其他人，而是在這裡整理舊文件嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是同等重要的工作啊，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本艦拆分之後，羅德島在各地的辦事處就要忙碌起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些舊文件，還不僅僅是我們去過哪些地方、做過哪些事情的紀念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們是給別人看的，也是給我們自己看的……它們能向所有人證明，我們能做到什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，松果幹員，你的任務日誌我這邊已經確認了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，我……能麻煩您幫個忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想調取自己入職後的全部任務記錄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米娜姐姐，你終於回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有去找他們要求解釋嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛德森，發生了一些事情，我、我不知道該怎麼解釋……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你怎麼辦，我們怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直覺得你很厲害，米娜姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爸爸出事，家裡發生了那麼大的變故，你都撐了過來。我聽說當年你甚至去曼斯菲爾德監獄幫助了西蒙家的大少爺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來你被迫離開了家鄉，來到這麼遠的地方，但你依然找到了一份很不錯的工作。可是最終，你還是只能就這麼回哥倫比亞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為拓荒規劃，我們的小鎮被迫搬得離移動城市更遠了，活路本來就很難找。加上當年你爸爸和西蒙家大少爺的事情……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些和我們打過交道的工頭和老闆們，說不定還會找我們的碴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這些我都知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你真的要一個工地一個工地找過去，一個人一個人地求過去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米娜姐姐，你有沒有聽我說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手裡拿的是什麼啊？回來之後，你就一直在翻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我入職以來的全部任務記錄。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一千三百七十二項任務記錄。\n事故率：百分之零點七。\n超標準完工率：百分之四十二。\n……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年又九個月……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，已經過了這麼長的時間了啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，我已經做過這麼多的事情……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛德森，不會發生那樣的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛德森","speakerId":"avg_npc_1796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米娜姐姐，你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我或許會帶著你回哥倫比亞，哥倫比亞或許也還是我離開時的那副樣子，但你剛剛擔心的那些事情……我不會讓它們發生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我要先去找一個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_3"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，米娜米娜，我正要去你的宿舍呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼~卡夫卡，我正要找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你聽我說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡夫卡，我知道你是擔心我，不知道該怎麼開這個口。/米娜，我確實有點不好意思，不知道怎麼開這個口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我其實已經知道了。公司遣散員工，我見過很多也經歷過很多。/在酸糖教我玩滑板之前，我不知道這個東西這麼有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大個子介紹我來這裡時，我只是想找一份穩定的工作。/它對於街頭上長大的孩子來說，就是警察的弩、上班族的咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最開始我也只能作為助手，在工程部幫前輩們打打雜……/酸糖說過兩天有個最高規格的滑板比賽，全泰拉的高手聚在一起炫技定高下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島是一家很好的公司，也是一個很好的家，它改變了我很多。/毫無疑問，這種比賽將改變我這種新手的一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三年多過去，我還是會出門的時候忘了帶工具包……/但是工程部交給我們倆的任務確實也很緊急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我的職銜其實變過很多次，我早就在獨立負責很多事情了。/我們要儘快趕到羅德島駐哥倫比亞辦事處……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡夫卡，米娜早就是一個成熟的大人，成熟的工人了！/幫助羅德島在當地組建一支自己的工程隊，以應對未來可能的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"成熟的大人不怕離開家，成熟的工人不怕在荒野裡創造活路。/我苦惱了大半天，米娜，可能得辛苦你一個人先動身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我決定回到哥倫比亞，組一支自己的工程隊！/但我最多晚一週就趕回哥倫比亞幫你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等到時機成熟的時候，說不定我還能回過頭來幫羅德島渡過危機！/所以這幾天，你就代表了羅德島工程部！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有這個能力！/你有這個能！力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果/卡夫卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辦事處……工程隊……啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，米娜，你是不是誤會什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上午在中層甲板的走廊，我聽見你和工程部的前輩……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前跟你說過，接下來羅德島會加速推進各地辦事處的工作。你們來自哥倫比亞，也熟悉那股拓荒的熱潮，就當出個長期外勤……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你和松果需要離開羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越快越好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒得商量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒得商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滑板比賽的事情，我理解啦，我自己還是滑翔傘愛好者，我倒是也相信松果能獨立處理前期的各種事情……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，你和酸糖比一場滑板，你能從她手裡贏下三分，我就承認你參加接下來那場比賽的必要性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工程部幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我必須自己說服松果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你從酸糖姐姐手裡贏下三分了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我贏了四！分！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是抱歉啊，米娜，造成了這麼大的誤會，讓你這麼難過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒關係。我也沒有難過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能我是個比較笨的人吧，來羅德島已經第四年了，除了偶爾寫信給爸爸，我很少會去想自己現在是什麼樣子的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安全帽、釘槍、工具包、軟軟的枕頭……上工、吃飯、睡覺、領薪水、偶爾和大家在甲板上唱歌……生活好像沒有變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但其實，其實……我早就不一樣了……啊，是很好的那種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，認識這麼久，我好像還是第一次聽你一口氣說這麼多話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，有、有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡夫卡，今天的事，雖然說不上來怎麼回事，但好像……好像結果是一樣的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會帶著愛德森先回哥倫比亞辦事處報到。然後我想要回老家的小鎮一趟，看看爸爸……那裡說不定也會有我們需要的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"松果","speakerId":"avg_440_pinecn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去跟工程部的前輩彙報吧，你說服了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡夫卡","speakerId":"avg_214_kafka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是你說服了我，米娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
